    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature you're aware of critically succeeds on a Strike against you.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are in your spotlight.</p><hr><p>You overload your spotlight, parrying the attack before the light goes off. You Dismiss the spotlight you are under, and the result of the triggering Strike becomes a success instead of a critical success. If the triggering creature was also under a spotlight, you can Dismiss their spotlight and your own to make the attack a failure.</p>",
